  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "An oxopurine that is uric acid in which the hydrogens at positions 1,3,7 and 9 are replaced by methyl groups. It is a purine alkaloid that is found in Chinese tea known as kucha (<em>Camellia assamica</em> var. kucha) and exhibits anti-inflammatory and analgesic properties."
  ],
